:: Bog Cult Sleep
<<set _autosavehere to true>>
<<sleep>><<effects>>

You dream you are in the presence of something dark... The darkness whispers incomprehensible words into your ear.
<br><br>
<<if $culttaskphase is 4 and $culttaskcomplete is 0>>
    <span class="purple">The whispers intenify as a seed that was planted within you begins to grow. You find yourself back in the faded room. Darkness oozes through the walls as tentacles grip at you through the walls. A tentacle rises before you. It leaks the same dark fluid as the rest of the room. Within its grasp lies a glowing purple idol of the Dark Mother.</span>
    <br><br>
    <<set $culttaskcomplete to 1>>
<</if>>

<<sleepeffects>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Get up|Bog Cult Salem Room]]>><</link>>

:: Bog Cult Salem Speak
As you speak, Salem is startled for a moment before answering. "O-oh geez sorry. I was meditating and didn't notice you speaking. What do you need?"
<br><br>
<<link [[Hangout (0:30)|Bog Cult Salem Hangout]]>><<npcincr Salem love 1>><<pass 30>><</link>><<glove>>
<br>
<<link [[Ask for more info about the fellowship (0:10)|Bog Cult Salem Info]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Back|Bog Cult Salem Room]]>><</link>>

:: Bog Cult Salem Hangout
You spend time hanging out with Salem. You sit next to <<him>> and follow in <<his>> example. It might just be your mind playing tricks on you, but you can swear you hear faint whispers.
<br><br>
After about 30 minutes the whispers intensify and you're shocked out of your meditation. Salem glaces at you concerned. "Are you alright?"
<br><br>
<<link [[Explain what happened|Bog Cult Salem Explain]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Yeah it's nothing|Bog Cult Salem Room]]>><</link>>

:: Bog Cult Salem Explain
"Oh that's nothing to worry about." Salem smiles. "That's the Dark Mother. She's our tutelary diety. Members of the fellowship can connect with her through meditation."
<br><br>
<<He>> blushes under your blank stare. "U-um I swear it's nothing I promise..."
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Bog Cult Salem Room]]>><</link>>

:: Bog Cult Salem Info
"O-oh you want to know more about our fellowship?" Salem's eyes sparkle in the candle light. "Okay so... Our founders were originally part of the church in town, but upon connecting with the Dark Mother, they were cast out and forced out of town. They wandered the forest for many days and nights before finally settling and building a temple in the woods. The records of the event are lost but the ruins of the temple still exist in the deepest depths of the lake. The elders uncovered the knowledge of the founders and refounded the cult out here in the bogs. It's quite interesting don't you think?"
<br><br>
"O-oh! Sorry was I speaking too fast I- I uh..." <<He>> blushes and falls silent.
<br><br>
<<link [[Back|Bog Cult Salem Room]]>><</link>>

:: Bog Cult Elder Task
<<if $culttask is 1>>
    You approach the elders once again. They look at you expectantly.
    <br><br>
    <<if $culttaskcomplete is 1>>
        <<link [[Turn in the idol|Bog Cult Elder Task]]>><<set $culttaskphase += 1>><<set $culttaskcomplete to 0>><<set $culttask to 0>><</link>>
    <<else>>
        <<link [[Back|Bog Cult]]>><</link>>
    <</if>>

<<elseif $darkaltar is 1 and isBloodmoon()>>
    "The time is nigh... Lie upon the altar child..." The elders gather around the altar in their ritual robes as you lie in the center. "Partake of the Dark Mother's milk child... and be shaped to her will..." The elder hands you a vial filled with the same oozing black liquid that haunted your dreams.
    <br><br>
    <span class = "red">Warning, this tf is a one time event and will replace your current divine tf.</span>
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Drink|Bog Cult Drink]]>><</link>>
    <br>
    <<link [[Back|Bog Cult]]>><</link>>

<<elseif $darkaltar is 1>>
    "Not now..." The elder speaks. "The moon must be the reddest object in all of the sky for the ritual..."
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Back|Bog Cult]]>><</link>>

<<elseif $culttask is undefined>>
    You approach the elders for the first time since your initiation. They gaze upon you, not quite sure where you stand. "So... you have joined the fellowship." An elder speaks up. "You must still... prove your loyalty." The elder lets out a raspy cough before continuing. "For your first task... retrive an idol of the Dark Mother from the old temple." The elder rests for a moment before speaking once more. "Well?... What are you waiting for..."
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Back|Bog Cult]]>><<set $culttask to 1>><<set $culttaskphase to 0>><<set $culttaskcomplete to 0>><</link>>

<<elseif $culttaskphase is 1>>
    An elder speaks up. "You have done well with the last task..." The elder lights a purple candle on the alter. "This time we require... another idol. Search within the tomb of peasants..."
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Back|Bog Cult]]>><<set $culttask to 1>><</link>>

<<elseif $culttaskphase is 2>>
    They light a second purple candle that flickers to life over the altar. "You have proven yourself to be quite... capable." The elder rasps. "The next idol is hidden within a maze of filth and grime... May your search be swift."
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Back|Bog Cult]]>><<set $culttask to 1>><</link>>

<<elseif $culttaskphase is 3>>
    They light a third purple candle that flickers to life over the altar. "Your dedication is quite... admirable. We near the finale... Find the next idol within the home of the old god..."
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Back|Bog Cult]]>><<set $culttask to 1>><</link>>

<<elseif $culttaskphase is 4>>
    They light a fourth purple candle that flickers to life over the altar. "You have almost restored the Dark Mother's altar... The joyous day cometh... The final idol is... inside yourself."
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Back|Bog Cult]]>><<set $culttask to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif $culttaskphase is 5>>
    They light the fifth and final purple candle over the altar. "The old altar is complete..." The elders gather around the altar. "The gift of the Dark Mother is ready to be bequeathed... Come soon, on the reddest of moons and her gift will be granted upon you." 
    <br><br>
    <<link [[Back|Bog Cult]]>><<set $darkaltar to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Bog Cult Drink
You bring the vial to your lips and drink the thick black ooze. You begin to feel ill as the liquid affects your body. Black ooze flows from your orifices as the dormant seed layed within you sprouts. Tentacles rip from your back as a crown of tentacled thorns sprouts from your head, digging into your skull.
<br><br>
You look over the members of the fellowship as they gaze upon you in reverence. The chosen one of the Dark Mother. They remove themselves from your path as you sit up and stretch your new tentacles.
<br><br>
